OL,3,GNEWSAParty 'never opposed' Bradford NPR
OL,4,Aplan - Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK has insisted it supports
OL,7,Fplans for a new railway station in
OL,8,FBradford as part of Northern Powerhouse
OL,9,FRail (NPR), despite its opposition to
OL,10,Fparts of the broader project.
OL,12,FThe party's deputy leader nationally,
OL,13,FRichard Tice, said it had "never
OL,14,Fopposed" Phase 1 of NPR, which includes
OL,15,Fproposals for the city's new station,
OL,16,Fbut remained against spending money on
OL,17,Fa high-speed line between Liverpool and
OL,18,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
