OL,3,GNEWSAParty 'never opposed' Bradford NPR
OL,4,Aplan - Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, questions remain over which
OL,7,Fparts of NPR Reform UK would support if
OL,8,Fit got into government, including a
OL,9,Fproposed new line connecting Bradford
OL,10,Fwith Huddersfield and Manchester.
OL,12,FThe city's Reform group say they do not
OL,13,Fbelieve the national stance poses a
OL,14,Frisk locally.
